---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import { photographyAwards } from '@links/registry';
---
<Layout title="Photography — Awards">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={photographyAwards} orientation="vertical" />
  <p class="intro">I started entering photo contests in 2025. Since then, my photos have earned nine results in
  youth competitions, both in the U.S. and internationally: two wins, a runner-up, a shortlist, two honorable mentions,
  two notable entries, and an acceptance.</p>

  <p>The photos all come from three places. Four are from my trip to Egypt, including my first win. Three are
  from the king penguin colony in Patagonia. Two are from the Mission District in San Francisco, including my second
  win. I'm still entering new contests, and I add each result here as it comes in.</p>
</Layout>
